{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"instancetype"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithStyleURL:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURL","text":"NSURL"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"styleURL"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bounds:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@MLNCoordinateBounds","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNCoordinateBounds","text":"MLNCoordinateBounds"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"bounds"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"fromZoomLevel:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:d","text":"double"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"minimumZoomLevel"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"toZoomLevel:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:d","text":"double"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"maximumZoomLevel"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"URL of the map style for which to download resources. The URL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"may be a full HTTP or HTTPS URL or a canonical style URL."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Specify "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" for the default style."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Relative file URLs cannot be used as offline style URLs. To download the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"online resources required by a local style, specify a URL to an online copy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the style."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"styleURL"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The coordinate bounds for the geographic region to be covered by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the downloaded tiles."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"bounds"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The minimum zoom level to be covered by the downloaded"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tiles. This parameter should be set to at least 0 but no greater than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maximumZoomLevel"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter. For each required tile source, if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this parameter is set to a value less than the tile source’s minimum zoom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level, the download covers zoom levels down to the tile source’s minimum"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"zoom level."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"minimumZoomLevel"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The maximum zoom level to be covered by the downloaded"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tiles. This parameter should be set to at least the value of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"minimumZoomLevel"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter. For each required tile source, if this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter is set to a value greater than the tile source’s minimum zoom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level, the download covers zoom levels up to the tile source’s maximum zoom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"maximumZoomLevel"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the